{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCoset","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCoset","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionMinimal"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCoset.isDistinguished_eq_of_mul_inv_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCoset.isDistinguished_eq_of_mul_inv_mem","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionCoset.lean#L71-L77","doc":"The same, phrased as injectivity of `d ↦ S_μ d` on the distinguished elements. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCoset.isDistinguished_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCoset.isDistinguished_unique","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionCoset.lean#L44-L69","doc":"**Uniqueness in Proposition 3.3**: a right coset of `S_μ` contains at most one\ndistinguished element.\n\nStated with the coset condition as `d₂ * d₁⁻¹ ∈ S_μ`, which is membership of `d₂` in\nthe right coset `S_μ d₁`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}